# ─── Build output ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
bin/
obj/
out/
publish/
*.binlog

# ─── Local configuration & secrets ──────────────────────────────────────────
# appsettings.json and appsettings.Development.json are committed and must
# hold NO secrets. Credentials go in `dotnet user-secrets` (dev) or
# environment variables (prod); see docs/setup/cloudflare-r2.md and
# docs/setup/ai-agents.md. Personal overrides go in a *.Local file.
appsettings.*.Local.json
appsettings.Local.json
secrets.json
*.pfx
*.p12
*.key

# ─── IDE / tooling ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vs/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo
*.DotSettings.user

# ─── Runtime artefacts ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
logs/
*.log
TestResults/
coverage/
*.coverage
*.dump
